t_rise = 0.35 / BW','{"choices": ["200 ns", "1.75 ns", "35 ns", "5 µs"], "correct": 1}'::jsonb,'t_rise_scope = 0.35 / (200×10⁶) = 0.35 / 2×10⁸ = 1.75 ns. Measured rise time includes instrument rise time: t_measured² = t_actual² + t_scope². For accurate measurement, scope should be ≥5× faster.','{multiple_choice}'::text[],0.78) ON CONFLICT (slug) DO NOTHING;

u_c = √(u₁² + u₂²)','{"choices": ["5 mV", "3.6 mV", "2.5 mV", "1 mV"], "correct": 1}'::jsonb,'u_c = √(2² + 3²) = √(4 + 9) = √13 ≈ 3.61 mV. Uncertainties add in quadrature (RSS) for uncorrelated sources. Correlated uncertainties add linearly (worst case). Always root-sum-square for independent error sources.','{multiple_choice}'::text[],0.65) ON CONFLICT (slug) DO NOTHING;
